            "review_text": "ToffeeAnge\nHong Kong, China6 contributions\n0\nReal Gem in Nha trang🤩, but cash only!😟\nDec 2018 • Friends\nSuppose look for restaurent next to it but too many ppl so we try this one.\nUnexpectedly good, thou only 1 mgr speak Eng, but other lady staff were frindly and try to accomodate our need. Also she advise us when we almost ‘over order’ too many dishes.\nMenu were ‘thick’ with lots of choice. After all it good price with nice setting—- most important not many ‘tourist’. Mostly Local ppl/office ppl go there... and their wash room were clean😎\nRead more\nWritten January 2, 2019",
