            "review_title": "Review at An Viet Thon Restaurant",
            "review_text": "chick e\nArkansas77 contributions\n0\nGreat atmosphere\nNov 2016 • Couples\nOn a day trip from cruise ship our guide took us here to experience the local cuisine and while it was good the open air ambiance is what really stood out for us. The name An Viet Thon means \"peaceful village\" and it was indeed a beautiful serene place to eat. We had strange foods i.e. Ostrich curry stew and eggplant with peanuts with a local beer. It was fun watching the various animals stroll through looking for crumbs also!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 16, 2016",
