            "review_title": "Review at An Viet Thon Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Grampam2013\nTwin Waters, Australia210 contributions\n0\nDelicous and Plentiful\nOct 2016 • Friends\nOur guide arranged our lunch here and we were very happy. There were 8 of us and we sat in the open but under a beautiful canopied thatched roof. James ordered for us and it was delicious, not one of us didn't enjoy the dishes, we even had an ostrich dish which is one of the people's staples you have to try it. Great service, lovely atmosphere and the best thing there wasn't lots of tourists, it was a local but quality restaurant. Would love to go again.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten December 16, 2016",
